spice
* SPICE Netlist
* Nodes: 1 (Common/Global ground), 2, 3, 4, 5

* Resistor r_pi between Node 5 and Node 4
R_rpi 5 4 r_pi

* Current Source I_1 from Node 5 to 3
I_I1 5 3 I_1

* Voltage-Controlled Current Source g_m*V_x from Node 3 to 4
G_gm_vx 3 4 Vx 0 gm

* Resistor R_L between Node 3 and Node 4
R_RL 3 4 R_L

* Voltage Source Vx between Node 4 and Node 1 (ground), measuring across Node 2 and 4
V_Vx 4 1 Vx_DC

* .END